+ * Android: PANEL_DEAD -> dsi_display disable/enable (power off, reset, DSI_CMD_SET_ON). Here:
+ * the off-command (0x28, 21 ms, 0x10, 101 ms) and 0268's full wake (on-command + PPS), then
+ * the DBV again. Backlight work loop.
